ile you're fast asleep, you feel a heavy weight on top of you. You open your eyes and see a strange man's shadow. Panic sets in. You try to scream for help, but the man pins you down and tightly covers your mouth.\n\nHe holds a pill in front of your face.\n\n\"Take this, or you die.\"\n\nYou can't walk. You can't run. Will you take the pill?", "summary": "A cute-turned-creepy horror visual novel", "themes": [{"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 20, "name": "Thriller"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/helping-your-boyfriend", "videos": [{"id": 199495, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "8mCzADGJ3L8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8mCzADGJ3L8", "title": "Helping Your Boyfriend - Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8mCzADGJ3L8/fhddefault.jpg"}]}